  "solution": {
    "approach": "Find the sum of all even numbers from 1 to n.",
    "timeComplexity": "O(N)",
    "spaceComplexity": "O(1)",
    "code": {
      "C": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main() {\n    long long n;\n    if (scanf(\"%lld\", &n) == 1) {\n        long long sum = 0;\n        for (long long i = 2; i <= n; i += 2) sum += i;\n        printf(\"%lld\\n\", sum);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "C++": "#include <iostream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    long long n;\n    if (cin >> n) {\n        long long sum = 0;\n        for (long long i = 2; i <= n; i += 2) sum += i;\n        cout << sum << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "Java": "import java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        if (sc.hasNextLong()) {\n            long n = sc.nextLong();\n            long sum = 0;\n            for (long i = 2; i <= n; i += 2) sum += i;\n            System.out.println(sum);\n        }\n    }\n}\n",
      "Python3": "import sys\n\ndef main():\n    s = sys.stdin.read().strip()\n    if s:\n        n = int(s)\n        print(sum(i for i in range(2, n + 1, 2)))\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n",
      "JavaScript": "const fs = require('fs');\nfunction main() {\n    const s = fs.readFileSync(0, 'utf-8').trim();\n    if (s.length > 0) {\n        const n = parseInt(s, 10);\n        let sum = 0;\n        for (let i = 2; i <= n; i += 2) sum += i;\n        console.log(sum);\n    }\n}\nmain();\n"
    },
    "notes": "Ensure edge case and standard I/O format handling.",
    "editorial": "Iterate i from 2 to n stepping by 2 and accumulate into sum."
  },
